{
    "title": "InstaSquare Photo Editor",
    "description": "InstaSquare Photo Editor-Filter&Effect, Square Blur Image Background is a powerful  photo editor and collage maker app for Instagram, WhatsApp, Snapchat, Facebook and Messenger etc you deserve.\r\n\r\nInstaSquare Photo Editor-Filter&Effect, Square Blur Image Background offers a lot of powerful photo editing tools. You can easily create a unique photo with insta square, effect, filter, text, blur, no crop, layout, sticker, emoji, frame, background, collage maker and much more. \r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fInstaSquare Photo Editor\r\n- Insta 1:1 square pic & no crop for Instagram\r\n- Insta square blur photo with professional blur effect\r\n- Apply professional effect and filter to picture\r\n- Crop, rotate, resize, blur, mirror, and zoom photo\r\n- Add stickers, text, backgrounds, borders, and frames\r\n- Choose multiple ratios, 1:1, 4:5, 3:2 ratios, etc\r\n- Paint your photo with color brush\r\n- Share pictures to Instagram, Facebook, Whatsapp, etc\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fPhoto Collage Maker\r\n- You can choose 1-12 pictures together\r\n- Create photo collage with 100+ layouts in seconds\r\n- Custom photo grid size, border and background\r\n- Simply drag and drop to adjust the image size position\r\n- You can also personalize your own scrapbook with freestyle pic stitches\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fMagic Photo Effects & Leak Light\r\n- 50+ magic photo effects to choose from\r\n- One-tap make your picture be amazing with leak light\r\n- Retro VHS, Bad TV, RGB\r\n- Glitch, Emboss, Pixel\r\n- Sketch, Moire, Monitor\r\n- Swirl,Zoom Blur,Motion Blur,Cartoon\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fProfessional Filter\r\n- Built-in 100+ professional filters\r\n- Lomo, Retro, Food, BW, Film\r\n- Nature, Color, Story, Youth\r\n- Each will make your photos be unique. Try it!\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fPowerful Photo Editing Tools\r\n- Best insta square pic blur photo editor\r\n- Pinch to resize the photo, rotate and move to customize\r\n- No Crop, square blur, doodle, and mirror feature\r\n- Adjust the brightness, contrast, saturation, and layout of your photo\r\n- With blur border and no crop layout, it's the best and simplest no crop photo editor for Instagram\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fFunny Sticker & Text\r\n- Built-in 500+ stickers to choose from\r\n- Add text on photo with 50+ typefaces\r\n- Adjust the size and position of stickers and text by simple gestures\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fFashionable Background\r\n- 200+ backgrounds to choose from\r\n- Blur background with professional blur effect\r\n- Set black background, white background and many colors\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fCool Photo Frame\r\n- Built-in 100+ photo frames to choose from\r\n- Awesome photo editor with cool photo frames, try now!\r\n- Export HD images to your gallery\r\n\r\nInstaSquare Photo Editor-Filter&Effect, Square Blur Image Background is a really easy photo editor and collage maker for social apps. If you have any problems or suggestions, feel free to let us know. Email: lydiamerritt6387@gmail.com.",
